SandAdmin attribution notice

SandAdmin is an independently maintained PostgreSQL fork derived from SaiAdmin 6.x:
https://github.com/saithink/saiadmin6.x

The inherited SaiAdmin source and its MIT license notice are retained in the repository root LICENSE.

The `sandadmin-artd/` frontend retains its own MIT license from SuperManTT. Source-file notices for Webman, Workerman, Art Design Pro, and other dependencies remain intact.

The package-management service implementations under
`server/plugin/sandpackage/app/service` include code derived from the
MIT-licensed `saithink/saipackage`. They are maintained inside SandPackage so
the public source tree does not require a separate compatibility namespace.

SandAdmin is not an official SaiAdmin release and does not imply endorsement by SaiAdmin or its authors.
